Goal predicates:

- (candidate_compliance_certificate_linked shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha) – currently not present. We need to assign compliance certificate to shift_candidate_alpha.

- (candidate_finalized shift_candidate_alpha) – not present.

- (compliance_validation_complete shift_candidate_alpha) – not present.

- (constraint_applied shift_candidate_alpha) – not present.

- (dispatch_ready shift_candidate_alpha) – not present.

